{
  "_readme": [
    "The app's own touches on each Chess Arcade theme, read by scripts/import-arcade-themes.mjs.",
    "Everything else (colours, patterns, artwork, board, pieces, fonts, sounds) comes from Chess Arcade itself.",
    "Per theme, all optional: label (else Arcade's), description, suggestedPieceSet, dark (nocturnal: its light mode is dark chrome),",
    "display (a font-family, else the one Arcade sets on its titles), analysisFromRepertoireLab (the analysis board keeps",
    "Repertoire Lab's palette for it), tokens (CSS variables in both modes: folder stamps, sticky note, clip, corners),",
    "lightTokens / darkTokens (the same, one mode only). A theme Arcade has that isn't listed here imports with defaults."
  ],
